{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45960","headline":"送杜使君朝觐 · 贯休","name":"送杜使君朝觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"借寇借不得，清声彻帝聪。\n坐来千里泰，归去一囊空。\n遗爱封疆熟，扳辕草木同。\n路遥山不少，江静思无穷。\n花舸冲烟湿，朱衣照浪红。\n援毫两岸晓，欹枕满旗风。\n道罕将人合，心难与圣通。\n从兹林下客，应□代天功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}